 the help of u.s customs agent  monica fuentes  leading to his arrest and full pardons  for the two ex-convicts  unbeknownst to the fbi though roman sets  aside some of the drug lord's laundered  money for himself  although he does turn over the rest  three once more brian suggests the two  of them use the money to open a garage  together in miami  although that doesn't wind up happening  the only main fast and furious film not  a center around  darm or brian tokyo drift follows  teenager sean boswell who was sent to  tokyo to live with his dad after  destroying most of a residential  construction site in a drag race in  arizona  relocating to a different continent  doesn't do much to curb shawn's  speedster ways  and he quickly falls in love with the  japanese street racing scene  the japanese drivers all employ the  technique of drifting  which allows cars to maneuver around  curves and corners  using controlled skids after initially  failing at drifting  sean eventually masters the skill with  the help of a local racer named han  unfortunately not long after han has  taken sean under his wing  the yakuza come after han for stealing  from them a high speed chase ensues and  it appears that han is killed  the final act of tokyo drift sees sean  challenging a yakuza member's nephew to  a race  which will determine which of them is  allowed to remain safely in tokyo  using his newfound drifting skills sean  wins  now established as a drift king of tokyo  sean continues racing  and the film closes with an american  arriving to challenge him to a race  dominic taretto who claims that he used  to work with han  along with the next two films a fourth  film in the franchise  actually takes place between two fast  two furious and tokyo drift  after tokyo drift ended with the reveal  that darman han used to work together  fast and furious cuts back to that time  five years after the end of the first  film  the film opens with dom stealing fuel  tankers in the dominican republic  with a crew that includes han as well as  dom's girlfriend letty  meanwhile after getting his criminal  record expunged at the end of too fast  too furious  brian o'connor is now working as an fbi  agent  tom and brian's paths eventually cross  when dom hears that letty has been  killed and the search for her killer  leads him to a mexican drug lord  that brian is also attempting to track  down together the two team up to  apprehend the drug lord  and brian manages to arrest him with  dom's help in the process  dom kills one of the drug lord's  henchmen whom he blames felletti's death  making brian's attempts to clear his  name futile the film ends with dom being  sentenced to 25 years to life in prison  and able to accept this outcome brian  resigns from the fbi and teams up with  mir  along with a couple members of dom's  crew to break him out of prison  the film ends with brian leading a group  of cars into said to dom's prison burst  picking up directly on the heels of fast  and furious fast five opens with brian  and his accomplices breaking dumb out of  prison  together with mia they flee to rio de  janeiro by this time brian and mia have  rekindled their romance from the first  film  and during the course of the film mia  makes a game-changing revelation  we have no choice but to split up right  now in order to build a new life dom and  brian hatcher scheme to steal 100  million dollars from a major crime lord  which requires them to recruit a crew to  help pull off the heist  this includes han from tokyo drift and  roman from too fast to furious  along with tej giselle leo and santos  meanwhile diplomatic security service  agent luke hobbs and local brazilian  police officer  elena neves are in pursuit of brian and  dom  however after the crime lord's men  murder hobb's team he and elena agree to  join forces with brian and dom  to help with the heist in a  spectacularly destructive series of  events that involves dragging a safe  through the city  behind fast-moving cars the group is  successful in stealing the money  after killing the crime lord hobbs  agrees to give brian and dom a 24-hour  head start  provided they leave the money the duo  agree but  only because they've already secretly  swapped out the money the real loot is  divided amongst the crew  who scatter across the globe each with a  hefty pile of cash  at the end of the film a domino elena  who are now a couple relaxed on a beach  with  brian and mia meanwhile unbeknownst to  them monica fuentes from two fast two  furious  gives hub a file that shows that letty  is actually still alive  living large following their successful  heist at the end of fast five  dom's crew is eventually reunited by  luke hobbs  who reaches out to dom for assistance in  capturing a terrorist  named owen shaw working as a member of  shaw's crew isletty  who has completely lost her memories of  her life before she disappeared in the  fourth movie  motivated by a desire to find letty and  restore her memories  dom's crew teams up to track down shaw  although he eventually gets away  in the process dom saves letty's life  prompting her to decide to switch sides  and stay with him  the final act of the film sees dom's  crew pursuing shore to a runway  where dom's group is determined to keep  shore's plane from taking off  with its weapons of mass destruction  they're successful in stopping shore  but gisele is killed in the process of  saving han shaw is grievously injured  after being thrown from the plane  and is subsequently arrested by hubbs  who secures pardons for dom and his crew  as payment  for their assistance at the end of the  film although letty still doesn't have  her memories  elena graciously steps aside to allow  her and dom to be together  meanwhile a grieving han decides to take  his fast five money to tokyo  where he and giselle had once talked  about moving which is what puts him  there at the beginning of tokyo drift  in a mid-credits scene it is revealed  that the person whose car crashed into  han in that film was driven by owen  shaw's brother deckard  who is now seeking vengeance on the  people who injured and captured his  brother  the seventh fast and furious film picks  up just before the sixth film ends  showing deckard shaw stealing  information on dom's crew from hobbs  office  injuring hobbs in the process shortly  after that sure attacks han in tokyo  which we previously saw both in the  middle of tokyo drift  and at the end of fast and furious 6. as  short targets the rest of dom's crew a  mysterious government operative named mr  nobody  offers to help dom stop sure if dom's  team can assist him  mr nobody needs help recovering a  computer tracking program called god's  eye  as well as its creator a hacker named  ramsay who has been kidnapped by  terrorists  after rescuing ramsay dom's team manages  to help mr nobody stop the terrorists  and subdue sure  who is taken into custody by hobbs in  the process  leti finally regains her memories  revealing that she and dom  actually got married before they parted  ways in the fourth film  meanwhile mia has announced that she's  pregnant again  and brian decides that it's finally time  for him to walk away from his dangerous  life  in order to be with his family the film  ends with the crew bidding a bond  farewell to brian  as he drives off into the sunset and dom  thinking back on all the happy memories  they've shared together  this ending also served as an emotional  eulogy for paul walker  who died in an unrelated accident during  the film's production  after regaining her memories of their  wedding the eighth fast and furious film  opens with darman letty taking their  long overdue honeymoon in havana  unfortunately while they're there dom is  confronted by a cyber terrorist named  cipher  who blackmails him into betraying his  crew and helping her steal weapons  the rest of dom's crew along with hobbs  and surprisingly deckard shaw  are recruited by mr nobody to help them  stop cipher  eventually it's revealed that cipher has  captured elena and her infant son  it turns out that elena was pregnant  when she and dumb split up and she never  told him  however while outwardly cooperating with  cipher dom  quietly tries to undermine her which  leads to cipher having elena executed  ultimately though dom is able to get the  upper hand by helping the shaw brothers  mother  who repays the favour by tasking her  sons with rescuing dom sun  once the shores have recovered the baby  dom turns on cypher  thwarting her plans to incite nuclear  war and reassuring his team that he'd  never really turned on them after all  unfortunately though cypher manages to  escape before she can be apprehended  at the end of the film dumb finally  names his son while hobbs decides to  walk away from his job with the  diplomatic security service for good  everyone meet brian  following the events of the fate of the  furious decade shaw learns that his  sister  hattie has disappeared along with a  programmable super virus  and is tasked by the cia to team up with  hobbs in order to find her  once they locate hattie who was an mi6  agent they learned that she only  infected herself with the virus  in order to keep it from falling into  the hands of brixton law  a terrorist who has been cybernetically  augmented with super strength  brixton frames both shore siblings along  with hobbs as terrorists  and the trio flees to hobbs childhood  home in samoa to figure out their next  steps  there they prepare to make their stand  against brixton's organization  etion alongside hobb's brothers as they  work to defeat brixton and his soldiers  one of hobb's brothers figures out how  to extract the virus from hattie  even if the process is frustratingly  slow after his defeat  brixton is killed remotely by the unseen  director of etion  who then insinuates that they'll be  coming after hobson shaw  you don't remember me  you will it's gonna be a hell of a  reunion  however hobbs and shaw are unintimidated  by etion threats  the film ends with the shore siblings  breaking their mother out of prison  and hobbs learning about the existence  of another potentially even more  dangerous super virus  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the fast and the furious films are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

